  "content": "\n\n<h2>星云闪烁（绿色）</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>功能特性</h2>\n<h5>（得益于这些特性，你的原版游戏体验将得到进一步提升）</h5>\n<h5>这将把你的原版附魔物品和盔甲标准闪烁效果替换为酷炫的深绿色星云闪烁效果，在黑暗中视觉效果极佳！建议在辅助功能设置中将“附魔光效强度”调至100%以获得最佳效果。</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>将其放入resourcepacks文件夹，并在游戏内的资源包菜单中启用。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/863/779/2024-05-10_02.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1857\" height=\"976\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/j58K0FVWknU?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即租用服务器，与好友一起畅玩！点击<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>或下方横幅 &amp; 使用代码 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 享受25%折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
